# /quote is a short URL printed off-site; /contact is the quote page itself.
/quote     /contact  302

# /services used to redirect to /services/porch-decorating because there was no
# services index. services/index.html has been published since 2026-08-26 and
# is in sitemap.xml, so the rule was shadowing a real page: the origin answered
# every internal /services link with a 302 to one service page instead of the
# section index that lists all sixteen. Removed 2026-09-17.
# Guarded by scripts/validation/validate_link_reachability.js, which fails on a
# _redirects source that names a published page.

# /authority and /hubs are section directories with no index page. Nothing on
# the site links them today, but BreadcrumbList JSON-LD named /authority/ and
# /hubs/ as the parent of their pages until 023124f, and Bing Webmaster still
# held both as 404 on 2026-09-25. Each goes to the live page that covers what
# the section held, never to the home page:
#   authority/ holds "party planner in Memphis" and "event decorator in
#   Memphis", which the services index lists as the celebration-setup family;
#   hubs/ holds exactly one page, the Memphis celebration setups hub.
# Guarded by scripts/validation/validate_link_reachability.js, which fails on a
# _redirects destination that is not a published page.
/authority   /services/                          301
/authority/  /services/                          301
/hubs        /hubs/memphis-celebration-setups    301
/hubs/       /hubs/memphis-celebration-setups    301
